{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“反复向前却未获支点、犹疑逐渐耗尽、向前倾向终于显为立场”的心理过程直接接在H47–H50上，M3补充了经历挣扎后的自豪与迫切，M6仍保留坚定不能替代安顿的主线，没有新增事件或宣告事情已经胜利。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把挺立解释为不再以受伤和害怕作为撤回在乎的理由，是由H2、H47、H50及M30支持的局部心理桥，既没有增加新的前史，也没有把脆弱消失或结果得到保证当作坚持的条件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"心酸与失重被解释为H7、H15中已有的温暖、怀念和失去感重新进入昂扬，而H50与M35支持柔软和不舍并未取消向前的倾向，没有引入新的伤害或改变原有主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都交代了当下的情绪表现及其与既有失落、坚持之间的心理因果，即使不看听感记录也能读懂这段经历如何从未获安顿的迫切发展为坚定，并容纳心酸与不舍；H、M编号和小节号只是辅助索引。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5f7a289-c122-4b59-a301-23e92284d702", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T145151986328Z", "elapsed_seconds": 129.875, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:54:01.860489+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "30d47a2274e2ef688be26f12a2391ed55fd94c8c8d2353fe4a2c8a815628c94e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tool